#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Available Quantity:</b> The amount of stock on hand that has not yet "
"been\n"
"                    reserved for delivery."
msgstr ""
"<b>Verfügbare Menge</b>: Vorrätiger Bestand, der aber noch nicht für\n"
"                    Lieferungen reserviert wurde."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Connected Printer:</b> Automate label printing by connecting your\n"
"                            printer."
msgstr ""
"<b>Verbundener Drucker:</b> Automatisieren Sie den Etikettendruck durch "
"Verbindung Ihres\n"
"                            Druckers."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Create Storage Categories:</b> Define\n"
"                        categories that can be linked to the capacity of one "
"or more package\n"
"                        types."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lagerkategorien erstellen:</b> Definieren Sie\n"
"                        Kategorien, die mit der Kapazität eines oder "
"mehrerer Pakettypen\n"
"                        verknüpft sind."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Create your stock locations:</b> Each stock\n"
"                        location can be linked to a storage category, a "
"barcode, and a removal\n"
"                        strategy. To create or update many locations at "
"once, use the built-in\n"
"                        import/export documentation and templates."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lagerorte erstellen</b>: Jeder Lagerort\n"
"                        kann mit einer Lagerkategorie, einem Barcode und "
"einer Entnahmestrategie verknüpft werden.\n"
"                        Um mehrere Lagerorte gleichzeitig zu erstellen oder "
"zu aktualisieren, verwenden Sie die integrierte\n"
"                        Import-/Exportdokumentation und die Vorlagen."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Define your warehouse flow:</b> Update your <b>Warehouse\n"
"                        Settings</b> to choose a 1, 2, or 3-step process for "
"receiving and shipping\n"
"                        goods. This allows you to tailor the workflow to "
"your specific needs,\n"
"                        whether you prefer a simple direct transfer or a "
"more detailed multi-step\n"
"                        verification process."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lagerablauf definieren: </b>Aktualisieren Sie Ihre "
"<b>Lagerhauseinstellungen\n"
"                        </b> um einen 1-, 2- oder 3-stufigen Prozess für den "
"Wareneingang und -versand\n"
"                        zu wählen. Auf diese Weise können Sie den "
"Arbeitsablauf an Ihre spezifischen Bedürfnisse anpassen,\n"
"                        unabhängig davon, ob Sie einen einfachen direkten "
"Transfer oder einen detaillierteren mehrstufigen\n"
"                        Überprüfungsprozess bevorzugen."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Generate a new invoice</b> directly from the existing <b>Sales\n"
"                                    Order.</b>"
msgstr ""
"<b>Erstellen Sie eine neue Rechnung</b>, direkt aus dem bestehenden\n"
"<b>Verkaufsauftrag.</b>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Going Further!</b>"
msgstr "<b>Weitere Informationen</b>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>In the Contact App:</b>"
msgstr "<b>In der Kontakte-App:</b>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>In the Inventory App:</b>"
msgstr "<b>In der Lager-App:</b>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Locate the customer's last invoice.</b>"
msgstr "<b>Suchen Sie die letzte Rechnung des Kunden.</b>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Login as:</b>"
msgstr "<b>Anmelden als:</b>"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manage your package types:</b> Define all\n"
"                        the types of packages you handle (e.g., pallets, "
"boxes). These will be used\n"
"                        to create <b>Storage Categories</b>, which help you "
"optimize warehouse\n"
"                        space."
msgstr ""
"<b>Pakettypen verwalten:</b> Definieren Sie alle\n"
"                        Arten von Paketen, die Sie verwalten (z. B. "
"Paletten, Boxen). Diese werden verwendet, um\n"
"                         <b>Lagerkategorien</b> zu erstellen, die Ihnen "
"dabei helfen, Ihren Lagerplatz\n"
"                        zu optimieren."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Manutention Report:</b> Provides details on completed transfers and\n"
"                            the number of packages created by type and the "
"quantity of products\n"
"                            delivered."
msgstr ""
"<b>Warenumschlagsbericht:</b> Bietet Details zu abgeschlossenen Transfers "
"und\n"
"                            die Anzahl der erstellten Pakete nach Typ und "
"Menge der gelieferten\n"
"                            Produkte."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Note:</b> Storage data is updated daily, so it's not live. Be sure to\n"
"                            select a date that is not today."
msgstr ""
"<b>Hinweis:</b> Die Lagerdaten werden täglich aktualisiert und sind daher "
"nicht live. Wählen Sie\n"
"                            ein anderes Datum als das heutige."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Odoo will automatically duplicate</b> the previous invoice,\n"
"                                    using the correct start date (based on "
"your defined invoice\n"
"                                    period) but setting <b>all\n"
"                                        quantity lines to\n"
"                                        zero</b>. This prevents accidental "
"overbilling and allows\n"
"                                    you to input the current period's "
"quantities accurately."
msgstr ""
"<b>Odoo dupliziert automatisch</b> die vorherige Rechnung,\n"
"                                    unter Verwendung des korrekten "
"Startdatums (basierend auf Ihrem definierten Rechnungszeitraum\n"
"                                    ), setzt jedoch <b>alle\n"
"                                        Mengenzeilen auf\n"
"                                        Null</b>. Dies verhindert, das "
"versehentlich zu viel abgerechnet wird, und ermöglicht\n"
"                                    Ihnen die genaue Eingabe der Mengen für "
"den aktuellen Zeitraum."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Open the CRM app</b> and create a new opportunity."
msgstr ""
"Öffnen Sie die <b>CRM-App</b> und erstellen Sie eine neue Verkaufschance."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Password:</b> portal"
msgstr "<b>Passwort:</b> Portal"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Picking Optimization:</b> Optimize picking with different methods like "
"<b>Batch\n"
"                            Picking, Wave Picking,</b> and <b>Cluster "
"Picking</b>."
msgstr ""
"<b>Optimierung der Kommissionierung</b>: Optimieren Sie die Kommissionierung "
"mit verschiedenen Methoden wie <b>Stapel-Kommissionierung,\n"
"                            Wellenkommissionierung</b> und <b>Cluster-"
"Kommissionierung</b>."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Putaway Rules:</b> Customize how products are stored based on your own\n"
"                            rules."
msgstr ""
"<b>Einlagerungsregeln:</b> Passen Sie die Art und Weise, wie Produkte "
"gelagert werden, anhand Ihrer eigenen\n"
"                            Regeln an."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Quality Report:</b> Gives information on the number of quality checks\n"
"                            performed."
msgstr ""
"<b>Reservierte Menge</b>: Bestand, der bereits für einen geplanten Versand "
"eingeplant ist\n"
"                            ."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Reserved Quantity:</b> The amount of stock that has already been "
"allocated for\n"
"                    a scheduled shipment."
msgstr ""
"<b>Reservierte Menge</b>: Bestand, der bereits für einen geplanten Versand\n"
"                    eingeplant ist."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Set up location-based fees:</b> In the configuration, you can define\n"
"                        different <b>Fee Rates</b> and link them to specific "
"storage locations. This\n"
"                        lets you apply different prices to various types of "
"storage, such as\n"
"                        refrigerated or high-bay areas. This granular "
"control allows for automated\n"
"                        and accurate invoicing based on the number of "
"pallets per fee rate."
msgstr ""
"<b>Standortbasierte Gebühren einrichten:</b> In der Konfiguration können "
"Sie\n"
"                        unterschiedliche <b>Tarife</b> definieren und diese "
"mit bestimmten Lagerorten verknüpfen.\n"
"                        Auf diese Weise können Sie unterschiedliche Preise "
"für verschiedene Lagertypen, wie z. B.\n"
"                        Kühl- oder Hochregallager, anwenden. Diese "
"detaillierte Steuerung ermöglicht eine automatisierte\n"
"                        und genaue Rechnungsstellung auf Basis der Anzahl "
"der Paletten pro Tarif."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Shipping Connector:</b> Connect with various carriers directly within\n"
"                            Odoo."
msgstr ""
"<b>Versandkonnektor:</b> Stellen Sie direkt in Odoo eine Verbindung zu "
"verschiedenen\n"
"                            Versanddienstleistern her."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<b>Storage Report:</b> Shows the amount of packages stored per day,\n"
"                            broken down by fee rate."
msgstr ""
"<b>Lagerbericht:</b> Zeigt die Anzahl der pro Tag gelagerten Pakete an,\n"
"                            aufgeschlüsselt nach Tarif."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>User:</b> portal@portal.com"
msgstr "<b>Benutzer:</b> portal@portal.com"

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Validate</b> the invoice."
msgstr "<b>Validieren</b> Sie die Rechnung."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Validate</b> the quotation to finalize the sales order."
msgstr ""
"<b>Validieren</b> Sie das Angebot, um den Verkaufsauftrag abzuschließen."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Validate</b> the transfer."
msgstr "<b>Validieren Sie</b> den Transfer."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid "<b>Validate</b> to finalize the order."
msgstr "<b>Validieren Sie ihn</b>, um den Auftrag abzuschließen."

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_home
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                            <strong>Stockio takes care of "
"your inventory operations</strong>, from receiving and storage to order "
"processing and packaging."
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_contactus
msgid ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                            Have a question, need a "
"<strong>tailored logistics solution</strong>, or <strong>looking for a "
"quotation</strong>? Our team is here to help you find the right way forward."
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<br/>Every business has different logistics requirements. Our tailored 3PL "
"solutions adapt to your operations, from warehousing and inventory "
"management to picking, packing, and shipping."
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<br/>From warehousing to fulfillment, Stockio provides the infrastructure, "
"technology, and expertise to <strong>simplify your supply chain</strong>."
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_about_us
msgid ""
"<br/>Since <strong>1975</strong>, Stockio has been building the expertise, "
"infrastructure, and partnerships that keep businesses moving.\n"
"                                            <br/><br/>\n"
"                                            Today, our <strong>European "
"network</strong> brings together thousands of people united by a shared "
"commitment to smarter, more reliable logistics."
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<br/>We handle every step of your order fulfillment process,<strong> from "
"picking and packing to shipping</strong>.<br/><br/>With reliable operations "
"and a strategic network of warehouses across Europe, we ensure your orders "
"reach your customers quickly and accurately."
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<br/>We handle every step of your packaging process, <strong>from product "
"preparation and picking to packing and labeling</strong>."
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.view_page_services
msgid ""
"<br/>With a wide network of over <strong>70 strategically located warehouses,"
"</strong> we always have a solution close to your business and your "
"customers."
msgstr ""

#. module: 3pl_logistic_company
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:3pl_logistic_company.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"<em>Example:  A category named \"5 Std Pal\" can be configured to hold\n"
